    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "The audio session mode, together with the audio session category, indicates to the system how you intend to use audio in your app.",
      "ko": "The expected behavior of an app is to pause playback if a route change occurs due to a device no longer being available ([`AVAudioSession.RouteChangeReason.oldDeviceUnavailable`](avaudiosession/routechangereason/olddeviceunavailable.md)).",
      "sourceHash": "638b96e142264635db5a7f088b2c14266c9e0254e6f4f0a0f67261344bf81db6",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "You can use a mode to configure the audio system for specific use cases such as video recording, voice or video chat, or audio analysis.",
      "ko": "비디오 녹화, 음성 또는 영상 채팅, 오디오 분석과 같은 특정 사용 사례에 대해 오디오 시스템을 구성하려면 모드를 사용할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "512ac15bb9c7bde92c1992184cde1534747ffcaaddf9b4e1d75ba265743337ee",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "[`AVAudioSession.Mode`](avaudiosession/mode-swift.struct.md) discusses the values available for this property.",
      "ko": "이 property에 사용할 수 있는 값은 [`AVAudioSession.Mode`](avaudiosession/mode-swift.struct.md)에서 설명합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "5b0dce4126fdbdf7c1ac83cd8b3e97b5fefef4d461a58eb37a9d33714b1e7021",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0002",
      "source": "The default value is [`default`](avaudiosession/mode-swift.struct/default.md).",
      "ko": "기본값은 [`default`](avaudiosession/mode-swift.struct/default.md)입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "96e9c9a82ddde7c9adab34aeabde5b73ca302e185346825617cf1597083f4d24",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
